          "text": "Work and social functioning"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Missed 3 days of work last month because she felt too overwhelmed to face the class; struggles with marking and planning; spends weekends recovering."
      }
    },
    {
